### Login siswa
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/mobile/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "access_code": "DEMO01",
  "nis": "4728",
  "password": "4728",
  "device_id": "ANDROID-DEVICE-001"
}

### Ambil antrean download paket soal
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/mobile/exam-package/queue
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "access_code": "DEMO01",
  "device_id": "ANDROID-DEVICE-001"
}

### Download paket terenkripsi lewat Laravel fallback
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/mobile/exam-package?access_code=DEMO01&queue_token={{queue_token}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
If-None-Match: "{{package_checksum}}"

### Catat download selesai
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/mobile/exam-package/download-complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "access_code": "DEMO01",
  "queue_token": "{{queue_token}}",
  "package_checksum": "{{package_checksum}}",
  "device_id": "ANDROID-DEVICE-001"
}

### Minta unlock key saat jadwal ujian dibuka
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/mobile/exam-package/unlock
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "access_code": "DEMO01",
  "package_checksum": "{{package_checksum}}",
  "device_id": "ANDROID-DEVICE-001"
}

### Mulai attempt
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/mobile/attempt/start
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "access_code": "DEMO01",
  "client_attempt_id": "local-001",
  "device_id": "ANDROID-DEVICE-001",
  "cached_payload_hash": "{{package_checksum}}"
}

### Submit final offline-first
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/mobile/attempt/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "access_code": "DEMO01",
  "client_attempt_id": "local-001",
  "device_id": "ANDROID-DEVICE-001",
  "cached_payload_hash": "{{package_checksum}}",
  "local_finished_at": "2026-06-03T09:30:00+07:00",
  "submitted_at": "2026-06-03T09:30:00+07:00",
  "submission_checksum": "{{submission_checksum}}",
  "idempotency_key": "local-001:{{submission_checksum}}",
  "exit_events": [
    {"type":"app_paused","at":"2026-06-03T08:45:12+07:00","duration_seconds":4}
  ],
  "answers": [
    {"question_id": 1, "value": "1", "answered_at": "2026-06-03T08:20:00+07:00"}
  ]
}
